    {"kind": "grammar", "level": "C1", "text": "___ the report, she emailed it to her manager.", "options": {"A": "Finished", "B": "Having finished", "C": "Finish"}, "correct_option": "B", "explanation": "Perfect participle clause показывает действие, завершённое раньше."},
